  },
  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Equipment",
    "section": "6.172",
    "heading": "Paired Items",
    "lineStart": 7018,
    "lineEnd": 7020
  },
  "section": "6.172",
  "rulesText": "Items that come in pairs - such as boots, bracers, gauntlets, and gloves - impart their benefits only if both items of the pair are worn. For example, a character wearing a Boot of Striding and Springing on one foot and a Boot of Elvenkind on the other foot gains no benefit from either."
}
